          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#2299aa\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>BloodPril™ </b>is designed to provide convenient daily nutritional support for healthy blood pressure, normal circulation, and overall cardiovascular wellness. As part of a healthy lifestyle, its formula can complement the body's natural processes and support everyday vitality.</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ul>\n            <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Healthy Blood Pressure –</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;BloodPril™ is formulated to complement healthy blood-pressure levels that are already within the normal range, making it a convenient addition to a balanced wellness routine.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Promotes Healthy Circulation –</b>&nbsp;The formula is designed to support normal blood flow and circulation, helping complement an active lifestyle and overall cardiovascular wellness.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports Cardiovascular Wellness –</b>&nbsp;BloodPril™ provides nutritional support for normal cardiovascular function and can be combined with healthy eating and regular physical activity.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Provides Antioxidant Support –</b>&nbsp;Selected ingredients may provide antioxidant support to complement the body's natural defenses against oxidative stress and support everyday wellness.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports Daily Energy &amp; Vitality –</b>&nbsp;By supporting normal circulation and providing nutritional support, BloodPril™ can fit naturally into a daily routine focused on maintaining energy and vitality.</span><br></li>\n            <li><b>Easy Daily Wellness Support – </b>BloodPril™ is designed to be a simple and convenient addition to your daily routine, complementing healthy nutrition, exercise, hydration, and other positive lifestyle habits.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article18-6m",
