          "_name": "content2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content2\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#e43f3f\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Read the recent blog posts about\n                Mobirise</h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row mt-4\">\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/12633/1550/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/diabetes-freedom.webp\" alt=\"Bacopa Monnieri Extract\" title></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"#top\" class=\"text-primary\">Easy and Simple</a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>Bonus #1:\n</b><div><b>Break Free From Diabetes –$67</b></div></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">A revealing handbook exposing 12 widely-prescribed drugs that quietly deepen insulin resistance and undermine your progress. Inside, you'll pick up natural methods to shield your body, keep glucose steady, and take charge of your wellbeing again.<br><br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More\n                            &gt;</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/12633/1550/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/03fortifyingvitamins-1.webp\" alt=\"Phosphatidylserine\" title></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"#top\" class=\"text-primary\">Auto Mobile</a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>Bonus #2:\n</b><div><b>Body-Strengthening Vitamins –</b></div><div><b>$49</b></div></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Digital book containing practical and manageable recipes for helping you to renew yourself from the inside. Using things that you have already in your kitchen, you will get to know how to relieve pain, reduce fatty livers, improve your vision, and strengthen your supplement.<br>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More\n                            &gt;</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/facial-rejuvenation-book-1.webp\" alt=\"Huperzine A\" title>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"#top\" class=\"text-primary\">Boost Your Rank</a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><b>Bonus #3:\n</b><div><b>Metabolism Boost Blueprint –$59</b></div></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Learn habits that will help boost your metabolism, reduce your belly fat and maintain your blood glucose levels without resorting to any crash diets. Simple habits which will return the feeling of lightness in your body and help you burn fat naturally.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href class=\"btn btn-primary item-btn\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Read More\n                            &gt;</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
